{"4063110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eagle", "steam_appid": 4063110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Become an Eagle!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063110/extras/93645dd2fc2f7e94eae366763cde454a.avif?t=1787127569\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open your wings as an eagle and glide through warm mountain winds. Catch fish, soar over valleys, and race other eagles as you enjoy the calm, freeing feeling of flying above a peaceful world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063110/extras/78d049d60cf7fad9905c7cf9a522119f.poster.avif?t=1787127569\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063110/extras/78d049d60cf7fad9905c7cf9a522119f.webm?t=1787127569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063110/extras/78d049d60cf7fad9905c7cf9a522119f.mp4?t=1787127569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Eagle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through serene mountain skies as a realistic eagle, exploring two handcrafted environments filled with life. Collect items, catch fish in flowing rivers, and glide effortlessly through warm winds as you take in the peaceful atmosphere from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063110/extras/5559501d0141d8401d7e54c095a2a626.poster.avif?t=1787127569\"